  "gui.inspiration.zero_point_generator.status": "Power %s / %s GFE ・ Amplifiers %s/%s",
  "guide.inspiration.chapter.energy": "Power and Charge",
  "guide.inspiration.chapter.energy.body": "Burn furnace fuel in the basic generator for 40 FE/t.\nPlace a machine next to it.\nCoal supplies 64,000 FE.\nFeed its charge slot too:\nInspiration = 1,000 mB.\nA shard = 100 mB.",
  "guide.inspiration.chapter.injection": "Injection",
  "guide.inspiration.chapter.injection.body": "Set a tier base under the Matter Binder, ring it\nwith Injection Guns, and the structure is built.\n\nBase material goes in the binder, the injectant in the guns,\nand a redstone pulse fires one discharge.\n\nThe discharge must land inside the recipe window\ntoo low and nothing happens, too high and it explodes.",
  "guide.inspiration.chapter.inspiration": "Inspiration",
  "guide.inspiration.chapter.inspiration.body": "Inspiration is the player's own will made solid\na thought that refuses to stay a thought,\ncondensed into something you can hold.\n\nIt is both a crafting material and machine fuel -\nwithout it, a machine with power still will not run.\n\nCrafting, eating and gaining XP build up Inspiration;\n100 points can be exchanged for one in the inventory screen.",
  "guide.inspiration.chapter.machines": "The Machines",
  "guide.inspiration.chapter.machines.body": "Matter Fusion Machine: fuses materials into one.\nEnergized Fusion Machine: the upgraded fusion machine.\nMatter Reshaper: reshapes one material into another.\nMineral Twister: twists ore, yields are random.\nInspiration Assembler: assembles parts into a product.\nCore Driller: sinks a shaft straight down.\n\nEvery machine only consumes power, never produces it,\nand most also drink inspiration charge.",
  "guide.inspiration.chapter.plugins": "Plugins",
  "guide.inspiration.chapter.plugins.body": "Four slots. Effects stack.\nCapacitor stores FE. Inspiration stores charge. Speed raises both costs.\nBasic x2. High-energy x4.\nParallel processes up to twice as many recipes per slot.\nCapacitor Downgrade: x0.67.",
  "guide.inspiration.chapter.radiation": "Radiation",
  "guide.inspiration.chapter.radiation.body": "Francium materials leak radiation into the chunk,\nand it builds up inside you as well.\n\nLeave the salt ore in the Nether, do not linger,\nand carry a Geiger Counter to read both numbers.",
